# ecs-task-definition.json is NOT used by the pipeline.
#
# The baseline task definition is created and managed by CloudFormation
# (aws/cloudformation.yml → ECSTaskDefinition resource).
#
# On every deploy, GitHub Actions fetches the live task definition from ECS
# via `aws ecs describe-task-definition`, injects the new image SHAs,
# and registers a new revision — no local file needed.
